      "id": 330748908,
      "body": "I\u2019ve heard that in Leonardo\u2019s journals, he rarely wrote about himself. They were mostly filled with observations about the external world and his inventions. I find it interesting that his mind was so consumed with physical reality rather than his own self and social surroundings. I think if you opened the diary of the median human it would be mostly consumed with social concerns and observations about oneself. Curious",
